// legendary (7). Models are those the client draws: prop, biplane, stunt for
// a common plane, jet, seaplane, twin for a rare one, delta, glider for an epic
// one, any of them for a legendary one, and supergnome for id 777 alone. Pilot
// is none or gnome; the super-gnome is the gnome, its pilot is none. Colours
// are #rrggbb in lowercase, the first three all different; on the
// super-gnome they are its cape, its suit and its emblem. The laser is the
// colour of the shots the plane fires; it comes last, added after the first
// version of the table.
//
